{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"sase-g2:000001:issue_created:sase-g2:ea8eb56515bf2f659afe40f94e677839201e911dc2a779e2d044524ffa433682","timestamp":"2026-08-06T12:52:25Z","actor":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","operation":"issue_created","issue_id":"sase-g2","payload":{"kind":"issue_created","issue":{"id":"sase-g2","title":"Diff-scoped selection soundness — measure the blind spot now, stop degrading silently, and stop depending on a CI artifact","status":"open","issue_type":"plan","tier":"epic","parent_id":null,"owner":"bryanbugyi34@gmail.com","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-08-06T12:52:25Z","created_by":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","updated_at":"2026-08-06T12:52:25Z","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"description":"The reliability of `just check`'s diff-scoped test lane becomes a measured property rather than an assumed one: a backtest over real historical commits reports selection recall against per-test coverage ground truth today instead of waiting weeks for organic samples, a missing or stale coverage-contexts baseline provokes a named and measured compensating action instead of silently narrowing the selection, an agent can see what the scoped lane actually did on the success path, and a workspace can obtain a baseline from a local full run instead of depending solely on a 14-day CI artifact.","notes":"","design":"plans:202608/selection_soundness.md","model":"","is_ready_to_work":false,"changespec_name":"","changespec_bug_id":"","dependencies":[]}}}
{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"sase-g2:000002:issue_created:sase-g2.1:603167422956e8840f6f0d8070646faf8d400cd8d186651e9d331fce7ea3593e","timestamp":"2026-08-06T12:52:30Z","actor":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","operation":"issue_created","issue_id":"sase-g2.1","payload":{"kind":"issue_created","issue":{"id":"sase-g2.1","title":"Historical backtest of selection recall against coverage ground truth","status":"open","issue_type":"phase","parent_id":"sase-g2","owner":"bryanbugyi34@gmail.com","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-08-06T12:52:30Z","created_by":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","updated_at":"2026-08-06T12:52:30Z","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"description":"backtest: add a `tools/selection_backtest` harness (plus a `just selection-backtest` recipe) that replays the last N real commits, computes the selection each diff would have produced, and reports recall against per-test coverage-context ground truth — so the epic's unmet exit criterion is answerable now rather than after weeks of organic sample growth.","notes":"","design":"","model":"","size":"medium","is_ready_to_work":false,"changespec_name":"","changespec_bug_id":"","dependencies":[]}}}
{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"sase-g2:000003:issue_created:sase-g2.2:1471913669327035d88c678a53ad2bce0139c18c82975089eed47c534f1dc05e","timestamp":"2026-08-06T12:52:35Z","actor":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","operation":"issue_created","issue_id":"sase-g2.2","payload":{"kind":"issue_created","issue":{"id":"sase-g2.2","title":"Make the scoped lane's selection and degradation visible on the success path","status":"open","issue_type":"phase","parent_id":"sase-g2","owner":"bryanbugyi34@gmail.com","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-08-06T12:52:35Z","created_by":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","updated_at":"2026-08-06T12:52:35Z","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"description":"visible: `tools/run_silent` discards captured output on success, so a passing `just check` shows only `✓ test (scoped)` and hides how many tests ran, whether the run escalated, and whether the contexts baseline was missing; surface a one-line scoped summary that survives the success path.","notes":"","design":"","model":"","size":"small","is_ready_to_work":false,"changespec_name":"","changespec_bug_id":"","dependencies":[]}}}
{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"sase-g2:000004:issue_created:sase-g2.3:136cace13163601c144d871d3186d25201a68a363a5c0f972e2039d0a914b3ab","timestamp":"2026-08-06T12:52:40Z","actor":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","operation":"issue_created","issue_id":"sase-g2.3","payload":{"kind":"issue_created","issue":{"id":"sase-g2.3","title":"A named, measured compensating action for a missing or stale contexts baseline","status":"open","issue_type":"phase","parent_id":"sase-g2","owner":"bryanbugyi34@gmail.com","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-08-06T12:52:40Z","created_by":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","updated_at":"2026-08-06T12:52:40Z","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"description":"compensate: `context-baseline-missing` and `context-baseline-stale` are recorded but are absent from `FULL_SUITE_RULES` and widen nothing, so roughly half of scoped runs narrow silently; choose and implement a compensating action on the backtest's measured recall evidence, and record it as a named rule.","notes":"","design":"","model":"","size":"medium","is_ready_to_work":false,"changespec_name":"","changespec_bug_id":"","dependencies":[]}}}
{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"sase-g2:000005:issue_created:sase-g2.4:fc93ed5168cdee9231ee2b2948008cdff4903b8e67e7ae03610d966bcf1dca1a","timestamp":"2026-08-06T12:52:45Z","actor":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","operation":"issue_created","issue_id":"sase-g2.4","payload":{"kind":"issue_created","issue":{"id":"sase-g2.4","title":"Record a contexts baseline from a local full run","status":"open","issue_type":"phase","parent_id":"sase-g2","owner":"bryanbugyi34@gmail.com","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-08-06T12:52:45Z","created_by":"bbugyi200.athena.tx","updated_at":"2026-08-06T12:52:45Z","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"description":"baseline: only `tools/fetch_coverage_contexts` installs a baseline into the host-local cache, so an instrumented local run's database is invisible to selection; let a local `cov-contexts` run install itself as a `<sha>.sqlite` baseline so a workspace is not dependent on the CI artifact alone.","notes":"","design":"","model":"","size":"medium","is_ready_to_work":false,"changespec_name":"","changespec_bug_id":"","dependencies":[]}}}
